<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">Efisa</book>
  <para style="h">Efisa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Efisa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Efisa</para>
  <para style="mt">Efisa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kai Pawl, Cathut e ngainae lahoi Khrih Jisuh e guncei lah kaawm e ni, Jisuh Khrih dawk yuemkamcu ni teh Efisa kho kaawm e tami kathoungnaw koe ca na patawn awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jisuh Khrih hoi maimae Pa Cathut koe e lungmanae hoi lungmawngnae teh nangmouh koe awm lawiseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khrih dawk kalvanlae Muitha yawhawinae kaawm e puenghoi Khrih dawk yawhawinae na ka poe e maimae Jisuh Khrih e Pa Cathut teh pholen lah awm lawiseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maimouh teh amae hmalah thoung awh teh tounnae ao hoeh nahan talaivan a sak hoehnahlan vah Khrih dawk na rawi awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jisuh Khrih lahoi maimouh teh cacoungnae coe awh nahan, a pahrennae dawk a ngainae patetlah hmoun lah o awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hottelah na hmounnae teh maimouh koe na poe e ka lentoe poung, a pahrennae hah pholen awh nahane doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Puk ka cawi lae a lungmanae lahoi yah, yon a ngaithoum teh a thipaling hoi na ratang awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hothateh lungangnae abuemlah, thaipanueknae abuemlah maimouh koe na poenae doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cathut ni a ngainae lahoi Khrih dawk a noe e hrolawk hah maimouh koe na panue sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kuepnae tue a pha toteh kalvan kaawm e hoi talai van kaawm e abuemlah Khrih e rahim vah cungtalah o sak nahane doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama e ngainae patetlah bangpuengpa ka sak e ni pouknae a tawn e patetlah maimouh teh Jisuh Khrih lahoi râw kacoekung lah o awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, Khrih dawk hmaloe ka ngaihawi e kaimouh ni a bawilennae hah pholen awh nahane doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nangmouh hai rungngangnae kamthang lawk kahawi, lawkkatang lawk hah na thai awh teh, hote Jisuh Khrih hah na yuem awh navah Kathoung Muitha hoi noutnae tacik na kin awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hote Kathoung Muitha teh a bawilennae pholen hanelah ama koe na ratang hoehroukrak, pang han kawi râw e lawkawm lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, nangmouh ni Jisuh Khrih na yuem awh e hoi tami kathoungnaw na lungpataw awh e hah ka thai hnukkhu teh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nangmouh hanelah Cathut koe lunghawinae lawk dei e hoi ratoumnae ka pâpout hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ouk ka ratoum e teh, maimae Bawipa Jisuh Khrih e Pa Cathut, ka lentoe poung e a ma panue thai nahanelah, lungangnae hoi thaipanueknae na poe awh nahan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />na kaw e dawk ngaihawinae teh bang hah maw tie hoi tami kathoungnaw ni a coe awh e râw teh banghloimaw a len ti e, hoi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />maimouh ka yuem e naw koe na patue awh e thao thasainae teh banghloimaw a len tie hah nangmouh ni na panue awh nahanlah panuenae mit a ang sak nahan ouk ka ratoum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hote bahu teh Khrih hah duenae koehoi a thaw sak teh Khrih dawk a sak e a thaonae patetlah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Uknae abuemlah, kâtawnnae abuemlah, atu e tue dawk dueng tho laipalah hmalae tue dawk kaw lah kaawm e minnaw pueng e lathueng, kalvanlae amae aranglah a rasang poungnae koe Khrih teh tahungnae hmuen a poe toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cathut ni a khok rahim hnocawngca pueng a ta pouh teh Kawhmoun hanelah hnocawngca e lathueng vah lû lah ao sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hote amae tak hateh hnocawngca hah hnocawngca hoi ka kuep sak e ni a kuepnae Khrih e a tak lah ao.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nangmouh teh ahmaloe vah namamae yon hoi sakpayon e yonnaw dawk na due awh teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />kahli dawk kâtawnnae kapatuemkung, lawkngainae katawnhoehnaw koe atu thaw ka tawk e muitha ngainae patetlah het talaivan phung patetlah hote yonnae dawkvah na hring awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Maimouh pueng haiyah ahmaloe teh, ahnimanaw patetlah hring awh teh, ma takngainae dawkvah hring awh. Takngainae hoi lungngainae patetlah kâroe awh teh, alouknaw patetlah a lungkhueknae ka khang e lah o awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hatei lungmanae hoi kakawi Cathut ni, maimouh a lungpatawnae kalenpoung kecu dawkvah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />sakpayon e yonnaw dawk kadout awh e maimouh hah, Khrih hoi cungtalah na hring sak awh toe. Nangmouh teh a lungmanae lahoi rungngang lah na o awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hathnukkhu, Khrih Jisuh thung maimouh hah Khrih hoi cungtalah na thaw sak awh teh, kalvanlae tahungnae hmuen na poe awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hethateh, maimouh lung na patawnae hah Khrih Jisuh thung a kamnue sak teh lungmanae hoi kawi e hah hmalae tuengnaw dawk a kamnue sak nahane doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lungmanae dawk doeh yuemnae lahoi rungngang lah o awh. Hnokahawi sak e dawk hoi rungngang lah o e nahoeh. Cathut e poehno doeh ka tho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ma ni kahawi hno sak e dawk nahoeh. Hatdawkvah apihai kâoup thai hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hno kahawinaw sak awh nahanlah, Khrih Jisuh thung sak katha e lah o awh. Maimouh ni hnokahawi sak awh hanelah Cathut ni sut na rakueng toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, nangmouh teh Jentel lah na o awh teh, kut hoi takthai dawk vuensoma lah kaawm e naw ni nangmouh teh vuensom ka a hoeh e naw ati awh e hah panuek awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hatnavah, Isarel miphun lahai na awm awh hoeh. Lawkkamnae hoi hai na kabet awh hoeh. Ngaihawinae hai na tawn awh hoeh. Talaivan Cathut laipalah na o awh e hah panuek awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nangmouh teh ahmaloe vah na kahlat awh nakunghai, atuteh Khrih Jisuh thung Khrih e thipaling lahoi na hnai awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, na ka taransakkung rapanpui hah a raphoe teh miphun kahni touh hah miphun buet touh lah a coung sak toe. Bawipa teh maimae roumnae lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Phunglawknaw dawk kaawm e kâpoelawknaw hoi kâkuen e kâlawk hah amae a tak dawk hoi a raphoe toe. Miphun kahni touh e hah miphun buet touh dueng e tami katha lah a sak teh a kâmaihawi sak toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thingpalam dawk taran a raphoe teh, thingpalam lahoi hote miphun kahni touh teh tak buet touh thung Cathut hoi bout kâmaihawi awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hote Khrih ni a tho teh, ahlanae koe kaawm e nangmouh hoi a hnainae koe kaawm e kaimouh teh roumnae kamthang kahawi hah na pâpho pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hottelah Khrih lahoi maimouh roi teh, lungthin muitha buet touh lah o awh teh, Pa koe kâen thainae kâ hmu awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, nangmouh teh miphun alouke nahoeh toe. Imyin lahai na awm awh hoeh toe. Tami kathoungnaw e miphun lah na o awh teh Cathut e imthung lahai na o awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bangtelamaw tetpawiteh, adu lah kaawm e gunceinaw hoi profetnaw e van vah, patuen pacoung sin teh sak e lah na o awh. Khrih Jisuh ama teh a takinlung lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hote takinlung hoi koung ka kâkuen lah a roung teh Bawipa hanelah kathounge bawkim lah a coung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hote hmuen teh Cathut ni a Muitha lahoi ao nahanelah nangmouh teh kaimouh hoi cungtalah sak e lah o awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hote kong dawk, kai Pawl teh nangmouh Jentelnaw hane dawkvah Khrih Jisuh e thongkabawt lah ka o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangmouh ni na thai tangcoung e patetlah kai koe na poe e Cathut lungmanae teh nangmouh hane dawk doeh kai ni ka khang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A lungmanae kai koe panuesaknae lahoi lathueng lah youn touh ka thut tangcoung e patetlah, Cathut ni a pâphonae lahoi yah, hrolawk hah na panue sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hote ca na touk awh pawiteh Khrih e hrolawk ka panue e hah na panue awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hote hrolawk hah tami kathoungnaw, gunceinaw hoi profetnaw koe atu e se nah Muitha lahoi a pâpho e patetlah alouke senaw dawk taminaw koe pâpho hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hote hrolawk teh Jentelnaw ni kamthang kahawi lahoi Isarelnaw hoi cungtalah râw a coe awh teh tak buet touh lah a onae lahoi Khrih Jisuh lahoi lawkkamnae hah cungtalah a hmawng van awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hnosakthainae lahoi poehno a lungmanae hah kai koe na poe toe. Kai teh hote kamthang kahawi ka pâpho e san lah ka o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pâphue teh ka baw thai hoeh e Khrih e kuepnae kamthang kahawi hah Jentelnaw koe dei pouh hanelah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />hnocawngca pueng hah Khrih lahoi yah, ka sak e Cathut dawkvah ayan e se pueng dawk hro lah kaawm e hote hrolawk hah tami pueng koe pâpho pouh hanelah kai teh tami kathoungnaw thung dawk, kathoungpounge naw hlak hai hoe kathounge lah ka o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, maimae Bawipa Khrih Jisuh dawk a yungyoe pouknae a tawn e patetlah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />kalvanlae bahunaw hoi hnosakthainae dawkvah, Cathut e kângairu a lungangnae hah Kawhmoun lahoi atuvah panue awh nahane doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Maimouh ni hote Bawipa yuemnae lahoi lungtang awh teh, Cathut koe kâhnai thainae tawn awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, nangmae bawilennae hanlah ka khang e reithainae hah na hmu awh navah na lungpout awh hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hete kongnaw dawkvah, khok ka cuengkhuem laihoi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />kalvan hoi talai kaawm e imthungkhu abuemlae a kungpui lah kaawm e, maimae Bawipa Jisuh Khrih e Pa hmalah ouk ka ratoum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ouk ka ratoum e teh, Muitha lahoi yah, nangmae thung lae tami thao thasainae hoi a cak vaiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />yuemnae lahoi Khrih ni nangmae lungthin thungvah ao nahan, lungpatawnae dawk patue e, tangpha a payang teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tami kathoungnaw patetlah hnosakthainae na tawn awh teh, Khrih e lungpatawnae adung, asaw, arasang, akaw e hah kapek teh na panue thai awh nahan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />maimae panuenae lahoi panue thai hoeh e Jisuh Khrih e a lungpatawnae hah panue thai awh nahanlah Cathut e kuepnae hoi kawi awh nahan ouk ka ratoum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Maimouh dawk kamnuek e a bawilennae patetlah maimouh ni pouk teh hei e hlak acawilah ka sak thai e Cathut ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khrih Jisuh lahoi Kawhmoun dawk talai apout hoehroukrak a yungyoe bawilen lawiseh. Amen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nangmouh teh kaw lah na onae hoi ka kamcu lah na hring awh nahan Bawipa hanelah thongkabawt e kai ni tha na poe awh teh na hroecoe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bangpueng koehai kârahnoumnae, lungdo lungnemnae, lungsawnae, lungkâpatawnae hoi buet touh hoi buet touh kângaithoum awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lungmawngnae hoi na katekkung Muitha dawk buet touh lah onae hah a cak nahanelah panki awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tak buet touh dueng doeh kaawm. Muitha buet touh dueng doeh kaawm. Ngaihawinae buet touh dueng dawk doeh nangmouh teh na kaw awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa buet touh dueng doeh kaawm. Yuemnae buet touh dueng doeh kaawm. Baptisma buet touh dueng doeh kaawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Maimouh pueng e Pa, Cathut buet touh dueng doeh kaawm. Ahni teh maimouh pueng e lathueng vah ao teh, maimouh pueng lahoi ao teh, maimouh pueng e thung vah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hatei Khrih ni poehno na poe awh e patetlah mama ham lengkaleng rip coe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Cakathoung dawk thut e teh, a rasangnae koe a luen navah man e san hah a hrawi teh, taminaw koe poehnonaw a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A luen ti navah ahmaloe talai thungvah a kum e hah a dei ngainae nahoehmaw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka kum e teh alouke nahoeh. A cawngca pueng kuep sak hanlah kalvannaw pueng a tapuet teh ka luen takhang e hah doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khrih e a tak hah sak awh teh, Cathut e a taminaw ni a thaw tawk awh thai nahanelah a pathoup awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A tangawn teh gunceinaw lah, atangawn teh profetnaw lah, atangawn teh evangelistnaw lah, atangawn teh pastornaw hoi kacangkhaikungnaw lah thaw lengkaleng a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hottelah a poenae teh maimouh kaawm e pueng ni yuemnae dawk hai, Cathut Capa panuenae dawk hai, cungtalah roung awh teh, Khrih e kuepnae hmuen koe totouh pha awh nahane doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, taminaw e dumyennae hoi yonnae koe lah tacueknae, cangkhainae kahlî aphunphun ni avoivang lah a palek e camo patetlah bout awm awh laipalah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />lungkâpatawnae dawkvah lawkkatang hah dei awh nateh bangpuengpa dawk lû lah kaawm e Khrih dawk roung awh nahane doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hote lû koehoi doeh tak abuemlah ni a kâkuet awh teh, kâletlout koe kaawm e pueng ni hai tha hoi akawi awh. Puengcang kaawm e pueng ni mamae thaw lengkaleng a tawk awh teh lungpatawnae dawk lengkaleng a roung awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hatdawkvah paletpalut lah ka pouk awh ni teh kahring awh e Jentelnaw patetlah bout na hring awh hoeh nahan Bawipa e kâ lahoi lawk na thui awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahnimouh teh lungthin mit a dawn awh. Lungthin patanae lahoi khoeroe a panue awh hoeh dawkvah Cathut hringnae hoi a kâkapek awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahnimouh teh kayayeirai panuek awh hoeh. Noenae dawk a sawtaw awh teh kakhin e hno aphunphun hah hoehoe a sak awh nahanlah mahoima radueknae kut dawk a kâpoe awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hot patetlah na o awh nahan Khrih e cangkhainae hah na kamtu awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jisuh dawk lawkkatang ao e patetlah a lawk hah na thai awh teh na kamtu awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahmaloe na hringnae, dumyen hounlounnae, lungthin hoi rawknae koe ka phat e tami karuem hah na rading awh nahan cangkhai lah na o awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hottelah cangkhai lah na onae teh a katha e lungthin na tawn awh nahane doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A katang e lannae hoi thoungnae dawk Cathut hoi kâvan lah sak lah kaawm e tami katha hah khohnat awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, laithoe e lawk hah takhoe awh nateh, lawkkatang dueng hah buet touh hoi buet touh kâdei awh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, maimouh pueng teh tak buet touh e puengcang lah o awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na lungkhueknae dawk yon bawk sak awh hanh. Na lungkhueknae roum laipalah kanîloum sak awh hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kahraimathout hanelah hmuen poe awh hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ouk ka parawt e ni bout parawt laipalah karoedengnaw a poe thai van nahan a kut hoi thaw kahawi tawk naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kakhin e lawk kam touh boehai nangmae pahni dawk hoi tâcawt sak awh hanh. Ka thai e taminaw hanelah ahawinae ao nahan a panki e patetlah roung nahane lawk dueng mah dei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ratangnae hnin totouh hanelah nangmouh tacikkinkung Cathut e Kathoung Muitha hah a lung mathout sak awh hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lungduemnae, Lungphuennae, Lungkhueknae hramkinae, tami minhmai ka mathout lah lawk deinae, hounroenae pueng hah takhoe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Buet touh hoi buet touh kahawi hno saknae, kâpahrennae, Cathut ni Khrih thung vah nangmae yon a ngaithoum e patetlah buet touh hoi buet touh yon kângaithoum awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hottelah nangmouh teh Cathut ni pahren e a ca lah na o awh dawkvah, Cathut koe kamtu awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cathut koe hmuitui lah ao thai nahan Khrih ni amae a tak hah a kâhnawng teh thuengnae a sak e lahoi maimouh lung na pataw e patetlah lungpatawnae dawkvah hring awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hatei, kamsoumhoehe napui tongpa yonnae, kakhin lah hringnae abuemlah, hounlounnae hah tami kathoungnaw ni a roun kawi e lah ao e patetlah lawk hoi boehai dei awh hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka kamcukamnat hoeh e lawk, panuilai, thangpoutlai, dei e patetnaw hai takhoe awh nateh pholennae lawk hah dei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kamsoumhoehe napui tongpa yonnae ka sak e tami, kakhin lah ka hring e tami, meikaphawk bawknae lah kaawm e hounlounnae hoi kahring e tami apipatet haiyah, Khrih hoi Cathut uknaeram dawk bangpatet e râw boehai coe mahoeh tie teh na panue awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Apipatet koehai ayawmyin e lawknaw hoi kâdum sak awh hanh. Hotnaw kecu dawk Cathut lungkhueknae teh lawk ka ngai hoeh e naw koevah a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, ahnimouh hoi rei kambawng awh hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahmaloe vah, nangmouh teh hmonae dawk na o awh. Atuteh Bawipa dawk angnae lah na o awh dawkvah, angnae canaw patetlah hring awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Angnae a pawnaw teh hawinae, lannae hoi lawkkatang dawk hringnae hah doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />BAWIPA Cathut ni a ngai e hno teh bangne tie hah kamtu awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahawinae banghai kaawm hoeh e hmonae thawnaw hoi kâbet laipalah hotnaw hah letlang pâpho pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, arulahoi sak e hnonaw dei e ca patenghai kaya a tho rah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Yon pueng teh angnae lahoi doeh a kamnue. Ka kamnuek sak e hno haiyah angnae doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, hettelah a dei awh. Ka ip nang kâhlaw leih, duenae koehoi thaw leih, hottelah na sak pawiteh Khrih ni angnae na poe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hatdawkvah tamipathu patetlah awm laipalah, tami a lungkaang patetlah kheikhei na tarawi awh nahan kâhruetcuet awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Atu e a hninnaw teh a mathoe toung dawkvah atueng hno panuek awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, pathu a hanh leih. Bawipa ni a ngai e hno hah kapek nateh ka panuek e tami lah awm awh leih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sak payonnae kampaisakkung, misurtui hoi paruinae hah roun awh nateh Muitha hoi kawi awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sam la, pholennae la, hoi muitha hringnae koe lah tha kâpoenae lanaw hoi buet touh hoi buet touh kâdei awh nateh lunghawi nalaihoi Bawipa pholennae la sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pa Cathut koevah Bawipa Jisuh Khrih min lahoi hnocawngca dawk pout laipalah lunghawinae lawk dei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cathut barinae lahoi buet touh hoi buet touh e rahim kârahnoum awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Yunaw, Bawipa e uknae rahim na o awh e patetlah vanaw e uknae rahim vah awm awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, Khrih teh Kawhmoun e lû lah ao e patetlah vâ teh yu e lû lah ao. Ahni teh tak rungngangkung lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kawhmoun teh Khrih e uknae rahim a kâhnawng e patetlah yunaw teh bangpueng dawk vanaw e uknae rahim vah kâhnawng van awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Vânaw: Khrih ni Kawhmoun a lungpataw teh amahoima a kâhmoun e patetlah, yunaw hah lungpataw awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hottelah yon thoung lah ao teh khinnae awmhoeh. Vuen cipeinae awmhoeh. Ka kamcu e hah Khrih ni ama koe a hnawng nahanelah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />lawkkatang tui hoi a pâsu teh thoungsak nahan hote Kawhmoun hanelah a hringnae a kâpasoung toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hot patetvanlah, vanaw, namamouh hoi namamouh na lungpataw awh e patetlah yunaw hah lungpataw awh. A yu ka lungpataw e tami teh amahoima hai a lungpataw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ma e takthai ka hmuhma e api buet touh hai awmhoeh. Khrih ni Kawhmoun hah a kawkhik e patetlah tami pueng ni amahoima e tak teh a kawkhik awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, maimanaw teh amae a takthai, a hruhrawng lah o awh dawkvah a takthai e puengcang lah o awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hete kong dawkvah, tongpa ni a na pa hoi a manu a ceitakhai vaiteh a yu hoi tak a hmawng dawkvah kahni touh roi teh tak buet touh lah a coung han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hethateh, hrolawk doeh. Hettelah ka ti navah, Khrih hoi Kawhmoun ka dei ngainae a tho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, nangmouh ni namamae takthai lungpataw awh e patetlah yu hah lungpataw awh. Yu ni hai vâ hah bari van naseh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Canaw: Bawipa ngainae patetlah nupanaw e lawk hah ngâi awh. Hot teh kamsoum e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Manu hoi na pa hah bari awh. Hotteh apasuek e kâpoelawk hoi lawkkam lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hottelah na sak pawiteh, nang teh talai van hringsawnae hoi hawinae na coe han tie lawkkam teh apasuek poung e lawkkam e kâlawk lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Panaw, canaw hah a lungphuen sak awh hanh. Bawipa e cangkhainae patetlah cingthui awh nateh kawkhik awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sannaw, Khrih e lawk na ngâi awh e patetlah talai bawinaw e lawk hai taki nalaihoi lunghringnae tawn laipalah ngâi awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mithmu dueng taminaw e lung karoumsak e lah awm laipalah, Khrih e san patetlah Cathut ngainae hah lungtho nalaihoi tarawi awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tami e san lah kaawm e patetlah dueng pouk laipalah, Bawipa e a san lah kaawm e patetlah bari nalaihoi a san lah awm awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kahawi e hno ka sak e tami teh san nakunghai, tami kahlout nakunghai, Bawipa koehoi a tawk e patetlah bout hmu han tie hah panuek awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawinaw, namamae sannaw koe hot patetvanlah sak awh. Nangmae Bawipa teh kalvan ao tie hoi ahni teh apie minhmai hai khen hoeh tie hah panuek awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A hnuktengpoung lah ka hmaunawnghanaw, Bawipa lahoi thoseh, thaonae bahu lahoi thoseh, kacaklah awm awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kahraimathout e dumyennae na ngang thai awh nahan, Cathut ni na pathoup pouh e puengcang hoi kamthoup awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, takthai hoi kaawm e taran hoi kâthe awh hoeh. Uknaenaw, kâtawnnaenaw, talai hmonae ka ukkungnaw, kalvanlae muitha kathoutnaw hoi doeh kâthe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, atueng kamathout e hnin dawk kacaklah na kangdue thai nahan, thaw na cum teh na ngang thai awh nahan, Cathut e puengcang kakuep e hah sin awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lawkkatang taisawm kâyeng awh. Lannae saiphei hah kho awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lungmawngnae kamthang kahawi pâpho nahanlah khokkhawm hah khawm awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kahrai ni na ka e hmaisene hah na ngang thai awh nahan yuemnae bahling hah senehmaicanaw e a van vah patuem sin awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Rungngangnae sumluhuem hah huem awh nateh, Cathut e lawk Muitha tahloi hai patuem awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pout laipalah ratoumnae a phunphun lahoi ratoum awh. Hottelah na ratoum awh navah nâtuek hai na thathout awh hanh. Na lungpout awh hanh. Kai hane hoi tami kathoungnaw hane hai ratoum awh nateh khenyawn awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hete kamthang kahawi e laicei lah ka o dawk doeh sumbawtarui hoi na katek awh. Hote kamthang kahawi hah lungtang nalaihoi ka dei thai nahan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />kamthang kahawi hrolawk hateh pâpho hane roeroe lah ao dawkvah taranhawi nalaihoi ka pâpho thai nahan kai hane hai ratoum awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kai dawk ka tho e hnonaw hoi ka sak e hnonaw hah na panue thai awh nahan, Bawipa koe yuemkamcu lah thaw ka tawk e ka pahren e ka nawngha Taisikas ni abuemlahoi nangmouh koe a pâpho han doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nangmouh ni kaimae kamthangnaw hah na panue awh nahan, ahni ni nangmouh lung na pahawi nahanlah ahni hah nangmouh koe ka patoun e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hmaunawnghanaw nangmouh koe lungmawngnae awm lawiseh. Pa Cathut hoi Bawipa Jisuh Khrih ni na poe e yuemnae hoi lungpatawnae teh nangmouh koe awm lawiseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Maimae Bawipa Jisuh Khrih lungpataw katangnaw koe a lungmanae awm lawiseh. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
